        "Illuga",
        "Nightmare Orioles",
        "Nightmare's Burning Heart"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Nikita: Illuga",
      "content": "Illuga is Nikita's adoptive son and a Lightkeeper squad leader. Nikita carried him from the ashes of his village after a Wild Hunt attack, taught him to track and strike down monsters, and placed him in logistics rather than throw a child into battle. Years later, worried for his future, Nikita still gave him the responsibility of the Silver Lampwick operation. Illuga calls him \"my old pops\".",
