        "Sigurd",
        "Undying One's Mourning Bell",
        "previous Starshyna"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Nikita: Sigurd and the Starshyna succession",
      "content": "Sigurd, a legendary Starshyna remembered for bravery, fell in battle against the Wild Hunt about a decade before the present day. Nikita fought beside him and took over the title, leading the surviving Lightkeepers in rebuilding the order. Nikita admits he lacks Sigurd's strength.",
