    "2": {
      "uid": 2,
      "key": [
        "Flins",
        "Moon Wheel",
        "lighthouse Ratnik"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Nikita: Flins",
      "content": "Flins is a veteran Ratnik posted at lighthouses and graveyards. Nikita knows he is fae and was once a noble, treats him as an equal and confidant, and asks him to look after Illuga. Nikita signs his letters \"Your Friend\", and once threatened to send Illuga over with a dog for him. In Wind-Stirred Ripples he reminds Flins of the battles they went through together since they became Lightkeepers.",
