    "3": {
      "uid": 3,
      "key": [
        "Silver Lampwick",
        "Pillar of Embla",
        "three sacred relics"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Nikita: The Silver Lampwick request",
      "content": "In Wind-Stirred Ripples (Nightingale's Song) Nikita approaches the Traveler and Paimon and asks them to find the Silver Lampwick, one of three sacred relics used by the Torchforger to seal the Wild Hunt's source. It summons a barrier against the Wild Hunt and was entrusted to the fae guardian Alia. He asks them to give it to Illuga.",
