      "key": [
        "Arrow of Terpikeraunas",
        "Spiralblade",
        "great mead hall",
        "Cataclysm Egg"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Nikita: The Arrow of Terpikeraunas",
      "content": "The great mead hall in Piramida was built to house the Arrow of Terpikeraunas, a bow and arrow made five hundred years ago by the Torchforger and the first Moonchanter to end the undying fiend. Once the Traveler recovered the Spiralblade as its arrowhead, Nikita told them the Arrow was ready.",
