    "5": {
      "uid": 5,
      "key": [
        "Piramida",
        "Lightkeepers",
        "Ratniki",
        "Ratnik",
        "Torchforger",
        "Solovei"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Nikita: Piramida and the Lightkeepers",
      "content": "Nikita's headquarters is Piramida, which stands on the ruins of the fae governor's palace; he says the governor's coat of arms is still visible on the foundation stones and jokes that buried treasure might remain. The Lightkeepers are volunteers who swear an oath, and Nikita says they were founded five hundred years ago by Solovei the Torchforger, the first Starshyna.",
