      "key": [
        "Kipumaki Cliff",
        "Wild Hunt source"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Nikita: Kipumaki Cliff",
      "content": "After a brutal Wild Hunt surge, Nikita sealed Kipumaki Cliff, the source of the Wild Hunt, and forbade anyone from approaching it. During Nightingale's Song the Traveler hears an illusion of his voice there, mourning a mother who died to protect her child. The cliff is where the Lightkeepers' ancestors sealed the undying fiend.",
